<title>JAPAN: KDD -6mth parent forecast.</title>
<headline>KDD -6mth parent forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			   LATEST	    PREVIOUS	   ACTUAL</p>
<p> (Parent)	     FORECAST	   FORECAST	  YEAR-AGO</p>
<p> Sales		166.50	     170.00	     125.74</p>
<p> Current	     14.50		17.00		17.74</p>
<p> Net		    8.30		 9.00		 9.61</p>
<p>NOTE - As Kokusai Denshin Denwa Co Ltd adopted a new</p>
<p>accounting rule in 1996/97, the previous forecast above</p>
<p>is different from the outlook that the firm announced</p>
<p>earlier this year under the old rule.</p>
<p>Under the old rule, its current profit forecast was</p>
<p>17 billion yen and net profit forecast was nine billion</p>
<p>yen. Sales forecast was 126 billion yen.</p>
</text>
